msgid ""
"The autopilot can be connected to either the battery's tiller connector or "
"to the motor connector.  If the torqeedo's built-in battery will be used "
"then the autopilot should be connected to the tiller connector.  If instead "
"a separate battery will be used then the autopilot should be connected to "
"the motor connector (and the built-in battery can be removed)"
msgstr ""
"飞控可以连接到电池的舵柄连接器或电机连接器。如果使用 Torqeedo "
"内置电池，则飞控应连接到舵柄连接器。如果使用独立电池，则应连接到电机连接器（内置电池可以拆除）"

