msgid ""
"An interface board should be assembled using the parts mentioned above and "
"connected as shown below.  The image on the left shows the wiring if the "
"tiller connector is used, the image on the right is for use of the motor "
"connector"
msgstr "应使用上述零件组装一块接口板，并按如下图示连接。左图显示使用舵柄连接器时的接线，右图显示使用电机连接器时的接线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:43
#: ../../source/docs/common-torqeedo.rst:46 01a640e15a834700b8c59737aa9a0fdd
#: 561ee55a8acb4fddbda853b058f8262d
msgid ""
"If the motor connector method is used with non-torqeedo batteries, be sure "
"to use batteries with built-in short circuit protection.  During early "
"development and testing of this interface, after applying large and rapid "
"changes to the throttle and managed to cause a short circuit within the "
"motor.  A short circuit, especially with large batteries, could lead to a "
"fire and serious injury."
msgstr ""
"如果使用电机连接器方法并搭配非 Torqeedo "
"电池，请务必使用具有内置短路保护的电池。在该接口的早期开发和测试过程中，对油门进行大幅度快速调整后曾导致电机内部短路。短路，尤其是大容量电池的短路，可能导致火灾和严重伤害。"

