#: f770f27e6a2e48ec8b326f1079c5cd2d
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 39 (Torqeedo) if the Torqeedo "
"is connected to serial port 1.  If another serial port is used please set "
"the appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 39（Torqeedo）若 Torqeedo 连接到串口 "
"1。如使用其他串口，请设置相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数"

