"  If another serial port is used please set the appropriate SERIALx_BAUD "
"parameter instead"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 19（19200 bps）若使用串口 1。如使用其他串口，请设置相应的 "
"SERIALx_BAUD 参数"

