#: fe3e28304ec342bb88bdd936433f7c47
msgid ""
"Battery voltage and current information are taken from the Torqeedo battery "
"or motor by setting this parameter"
msgstr "通过设置此参数从 Torqeedo 电池或电机获取电池电压和电流信息"

